  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまの　とっきで　せいぶつの\nきもちを　かんじとる。　おだやかな\nものにしか　こころを　ひらかない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리의 돌기로 생물의\n기분을 감지한다. 온화한\n자에게만 마음을 연다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "透過頭部的突起物\n來感應生物的情感。\n只對溫和的人敞開心扉。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La protubérance sur sa tête lui permet\nde percevoir les émotions des êtres vivants.\nIl n’accorde sa confiance qu’aux gens calmes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit dem Fortsatz an seinem Kopf kann es die\nGefühle von Lebewesen wahrnehmen. Es öffnet\nnur geruhsam veranlagten Leuten sein Herz.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percibe los sentimientos de los seres vivos con la\nprotuberancia de la cabeza. Solo abre su corazón\na quienes muestren un carácter sosegado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percepisce lo stato d’animo degli esseri viventi\ntramite la protuberanza sulla testa. Apre il suo\ncuore solo alle persone di indole pacifica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Via the protrusion on its head, it senses other\ncreatures’ emotions. If you don’t have a calm\ndisposition, it will never warm up to you.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭の　突起で　生物の\n気持ちを　感じとる。　穏やかな\nものにしか　心を　開かない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "通过头部的突起物\n来感应生物的情感。\n只对温和的人敞开心扉。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percibe los sentimientos de los seres vivos con la\nprotuberancia de la cabeza. Solo abre su corazón\na quienes muestren un carácter sosegado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひとけの　ない　ばしょが　すき。\nつよい　かんじょうを　かんじとると\nいちもくさんに　にげだしてしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "인적이 드문 곳을 좋아한다.\n강한 감정이 느껴지면\n쏜살같이 도망쳐버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喜歡沒有人煙的地方。\n一旦感覺到強烈的情感，\n就會一溜煙地逃走。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il aime les lieux inhabités.\nS’il perçoit des émotions trop fortes,\nil s’enfuit aussi vite que possible.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es liebt Orte, wo sonst niemand ist. Nimmt es\nstarke Emotionen wahr, macht es sich so schnell\nes kann aus dem Staub.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siente predilección por los lugares despoblados.\nSi percibe una emoción intensa, emprende la\nhuida a toda prisa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gli piacciono i luoghi disabitati. Se percepisce\nla presenza di emozioni forti, se la dà a gambe\nlevate.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "If this Pokémon senses a strong emotion, it\nwill run away as fast as it can. It prefers areas\nwithout people.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人気の　ない　場所が　好き。\n強い　感情を　感じとると\n一目散に　逃げ出してしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喜欢没有人烟的地方。\n一旦感觉到强烈的感情，\n就会一溜烟地逃走。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siente predilección por los lugares despoblados.\nSi percibe una emoción intensa, emprende la\nhuida a toda prisa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
